weaknesses.issue:
There is no risk section. Section 10 asserts 'implementation failure is minimal'. Unaddressed risks include:
- livestock mortality and disease, especially if inputs are distributed in the monsoon;
- delays at DDRC/medical boards and in pension sanction;
- dependence on officials attending camps;
- market access for eggs and mushrooms;
- elite capture or conflict within the Sangathan and its leader's buy-in to formalisation;
- intra-household control of new income;
- residual LWE-related access issues, which the draft itself mentions.
